  "filter-on-desc": "Yu stap filtarem ol kad long bod ia. Klik long ples ia blong jenisim filta.",
  "filter-to-selection": "Filtarem i go long ol samting we yu jusum",
  "other-filters-label": "Ol Narafala Filta",
  "advanced-filter-label": "Filta wetem moa opsen",
  "advanced-filter-description": "Filta wetem moa opsen i letem yu raetem wan laen we i gat ol opereta ia: == != <= >= && || ( ) Wan spes i seraotem ol Opereta. Yu save filtarem evri Spesel Fil taem yu raetem nem mo valiu blong olgeta. Eksampol: Field1 == Value1. Not: Sapos ol fil o valiu oli gat spes, yu mas putum olgeta insaed long ol singel mak blong kotem. Eksampol: 'Field 1' == 'Value 1'. Blong jampem ol singel leta blong kontrol (' \\/), yu save yusum \\. Eksampol: Field1 == I\\'m. Yu save joenem plante kondisen tu. Eksampol: F1 == V1 || F1 == V2. Nomol, evri opereta oli ridim long lefsaed i go long raetsaed. Yu save jenisim oda taem yu putum ol braket. Eksampol: F1 == V1 && ( F2 == V2 || F2 == V3 ). Yu save lukaotem ol fil blong raeting wetem regex tu: F1 == /Tes.*/i",
  "fullname": "Ful Nem",
  "header-logo-title": "Gobak long pej blong ol bod blong yu.",
  "show-activities": "Soemaot Ol wok",
  "headerBarCreateBoardPopup-title": "Mekem wan bod",
  "home": "Hom",
  "import": "Tekem i kam",
  "impersonate-user": "Mekem olsem yu yusa ia",
  "link": "Link blong joenem",
  "import-board": "karem i kam bod",
  "import-board-c": "Karem i kam bod",
  "import-board-instruction-kanboard": "Putum kopi blong JSON eksport blong Kanboard: wan objek wetem \"columns\" (o ol wok we oli gat column_name) mo wan array blong \"tasks\" (title, description, column_name, swimlane_name, date_due, owner, tags). Ol kolom oli kam ol lis mo ol wok oli kam ol kad.",
  "import-board-instruction-deck": "Putum kopi blong JSON blong wan bod blong NextCloud Deck (wan bod wetem \"stacks\", mo wanwan stack i gat \"cards\" blong hem). Ol stack oli kam ol lis mo ol kad oli kam ol kad.",
  "import-board-instruction-openproject": "Putum kopi blong JSON koleksen blong work-packages blong OpenProject (GET /api/v3/work_packages). Ol stet oli kam ol lis mo ol pakej blong wok oli kam ol kad.",
  "import-board-instruction-issues": "Putum kopi blong JSON array blong ol isu blong __sourceName__ (__endpoint__). Ol isu oli kam ol kad we oli grupum long ol lis blong ol wok we oli open / we oli satem.",
  "import-board-instruction-asana": "Putum kopi blong JSON eksport blong ol wok blong Asana ({ \"data\": [...] } long eksport blong Asana o GET /tasks). Oli grupum ol wok long ol seksen (memberships); ol wok we oli finis oli go long Finis.",
  "import-board-instruction-zenkit": "Putum kopi blong JSON eksport blong wan lis blong ZenKit ({ \"title\", \"stages\":[...], \"items\":[...] }). Ol step oli kam ol lis mo ol samting oli kam ol kad.",
  "import-board-instruction-trello": "Long bod blong Trello blong yu, go long 'Menu', afta 'More', 'Print and Export', 'Export JSON', mo kopiem teks we i kamaot.",
  "import-board-instruction-csv": "Putum kopi blong ol valiu we koma i seraotem (CSV) / ol valiu we tab i seraotem (TSV).",
  "import-board-instruction-jira": "Putum kopi blong JSON long lukaot blong isu blong Jira Cloud REST API (GET /rest/api/3/search/jql), o wan objek we i semmak olsem { \"issues\": [...] }. Ol stet blong Jira oli kam ol lis mo ol isu oli kam ol kad. Yu save adem wan array blong \"automationRules\" blong importem ol rul.",
  "import-board-instruction-excel": "Jusum wan .xlsx spredsit long fasin blong WeKan (ol sem kolom olsem eksport blong Excel: Title, Description, Status/List, Members, Labels, ol det, ol kastom fil). Fas laen i hed blong tebol.",
  "import-excel-file": "Excel fael (.xlsx)",
  "import-board-instruction-wekan": "Long bod blong yu, go long 'Menu', afta 'Export board', mo kopiem teks long fael we yu daonlodem.",
  "import-board-instruction-about-errors": "Sapos yu kasem ol eroa taem yu karem i kam bod, samtaem karem i kam i wok yet, mo bod i stap long pej blong Olgeta Bod.",
