  "heading-notes": "Ol not",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Fasin blong Lukaotem",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Taem yu lukaotem, yu save yusum ol opereta blong mekem lukaotem i stret moa. Yu raetem nem blong opereta mo valiu, we wan kolon i seraotem. Eksampol, opereta `lis:Blocked` bae i lukaotem ol kad we oli stap insaed long wan lis we nem blong hem *Blocked* nomo. Sapos valiu i gat spes o spesel leta, hem i mas stap insaed long ol mak blong kotem (olsem `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Ol opereta we yu save yusum:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - ol kad insaed long ol bod we oli stret wetem *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - ol kad insaed long ol lis we oli stret wetem *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - ol kad insaed long ol swimlane we oli stret wetem *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - ol kad wetem wan komen containing *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - ol kad hemia have wan mak matching *<color>* o *<name>",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - sotfala fasin blong `__operator_label__:<color>` o `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - ol kad wea *<username>* i wan *memba* o *assignee*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - shorthand blong `yusa:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - ol kad wea *<username>* i wan *memba*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - ol kad wea *<username>* i wan *assignee*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - ol kad wea *<username>* i card's creator",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - ol kad belonging long wan bod assigned long ogenaesesen *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - ol kad belonging long wan bod assigned long tim *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - ol kad which oli mas finis up long *<n>* days long now. `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ ol lis evriwan ol kad past their mas finis deit.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - ol kad which oli bin mekem finis *<n>* days ago o smol",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - ol kad we oli jenisim *<n>* dei i pas o smol moa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - wea *<status>* i one blong following:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - putum long akaev ol kad",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - evri kad, we oli stap long akaev mo we oli no stap",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - ol kad wetem wan en deit",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - ol kad nomo insaed long pablik ol bod",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - ol kad nomo insaed long praevet ol bod",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - wea *<field>* i one blong `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` o `__predicate_member__`. Placing wan `-` insaed long front blong *<field>* searches blong absence blong wan value insaed long hemia field (e.g. `has:-mas finis` searches blong ol kad we i no gat wan mas finis deit).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - wea *<sort-name>* i one blong `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` o `__predicate_modified__`. For wan descending sort, place wan `-` insaed long front blong sort nem.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - wea *<n>* i wan positive integer expressing number blong ol kad long stap displayed per page.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Yu save raetem plante opereta.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Ol opereta we oli sem oli joen wetem *OR*. Ol kad we oli stret wetem eni long ol kondisen bae oli kamaot.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` bae i soemaot ol kad we oli stap insaed long eni lis we nem blong hem *Blocked* o *Available*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Ol opereta we oli defren oli joen wetem *AND*. Ol kad we oli stret wetem evri opereta we oli defren nomo oli kamaot. `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` i soemaot ol kad insaed long lis *Available* we oli gat wan mak *red* nomo.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Yu save raetem ol dei olsem wan ful namba we i antap o daon long zero, o yusum `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` o `__predicate_year__` blong taem blong naoia.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Taem yu lukaotem raeting, bigfala o smol leta i no impoten.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Long stamba seting, oli no lukaotem ol kad we oli stap long akaev.",
