  "r-wrike-workflow": "Rod blong wok blong Wrike",
  "r-wrike-workflow-note": "Wan rod blong wok blong Wrike i wan lis blong ol stetas, evri wan i stap long grup Active, Completed, Deferred o Cancelled. Eksport i raetem ol lis blong bod ia olsem wan, we i karem nem blong bod, long JSON we API blong Wrike i givim blong ol rod blong wok: mekem rod blong wok ia long Wrike bifo yu karem Wrike Excel eksport blong bod i kam, blong oli yusum ol stetas blong hem. Import i ridim JSON ia we yu pestem antap, we i kam long WeKan o long GET /workflows blong Wrike, i go long bod we yu jusum: wan stetas we i no gat lis i kam wan lis, mo wan rul i makem wan kad se i finis taem oli muvum i go long wan stetas Completed o Cancelled, mo se i no finis long Active o Deferred. Yu no save sendem ol rul blong otomesen blong Wrike i kamaot long Wrike.",
