  "password-length-no-results": "I no gat akaon long ples ia.",
  "password-length-report-desc": "Ol akaon we oli saen-in wetem wan paswod we i sot moa long smol longfala. Bravsa nomo i save hamas paswod i long, ale hem i ripotem wan sot paswod afta long saen-in; paswod mo longfala blong hem oli neva lego bravsa. Stretem i taem we paswod blong akaon i jenis - wan akaon we i saen-in bakegen wetem sot paswod bambae i soem bakegen se i sot tumas.",
  "password-length-saved": "I sevem finis.",
  "password-min-length": "Smol longfala blong paswod",
  "password-min-length-description": "Saen-in wetem wan sot paswod i stap long lis daon. Saen-in i neva blokem from samting ia.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Mekem man i folem smol longfala",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Wan niu paswod we i sot moa bambae oli no akseptem, mo wan akaon we i saen-in wetem sot paswod i mas jenisim fastaem bifo long eni narafala samting. Taem yu jenisim, evri sesen blong akaon i aot. Ol paswod blong LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS mo Sandstorm oli blong provaeda blong olgeta, mo oli no jekem.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Saet ia naoia i nidim ol paswod we i gat __min__ leta o moa, mo paswod blong yu i sot moa. Jusum wan we i long moa blong gohed. Afta, evri sesen blong akaon blong yu i aot, mo yu saen-in bakegen wetem niu paswod.",
  "date-format-for-everyone": "Fasin blong soem deit blong evriwan",
