  "show-unread-changes": "Makem ol kad we oli jenis afta las taem mi openem",
  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Wan kad we taetol, stori, ol deit, ol mak, ol memba, ol jeklis, ol atajmen o ol toktok blong hem i jenis afta las taem yu openem, bambae i gat wan blu saed long smol kad blong hem, kasem taem yu openem.",
  "keep-title-tags": "Kipim #mak mo @memba long taetol blong ol niu kad",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "Taem yu jusum wan mak wetem # o wan memba wetem @ taem yu stap raetem taetol blong wan niu kad, kipim tekis ia long taetol tu. Of: mak o memba i tekem ples blong tekis ia.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Soem aot-lain blong fokas",
  "keep-add-card-form-open": "Livim fom blong Adem kad i stap open afta we yu adem wan kad",
  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "On: afta we yu adem wan kad, fom i stap open wetem wan taetel we i emti blong nekis kad. Of: fom i satem stret taem we kad i kam insaed.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Tanem [mak] long stat blong taetol blong niu kad i kam wan mak",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Taem taetol blong wan niu kad i stat wetem [Tekis] mo i gat moa tekis biaen, Tekis i kam wan mak blong kad (oli mekem sapos bod i no gat mak wetem nem ia) mo oli tekemaot long taetol. Of: taetol i stap olsem we i stap.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Sendem ol edita wetem Enta",
  "submit-on-enter-description": "Taem i on, sapos yu presem Enta, hem i sevem taetol blong kad, diskripsen mo ol narafala edita; Shift+Enter i putum wan niu laen. Taem i of, Ctrl/Cmd+Enter i sevem mo Enter i putum wan niu laen.",
