  "subtask-mark-not-done": "Makem smol wok se i no finis",
  "subtask-done-no-permission": "Yu no save jenisim sapos smol wok ia i finis o no",
  "board-view-calendar-mode": "Fasin blong kalenda",
  "board-view-multiboard-cal": "Kalenda blong plante bod",
  "wip-limit-groups": "Ol Limit blong WIP (Lis)",
  "wip-limit-group-name-placeholder": "Nem (yu save jusum)",
  "wip-limit-group-add": "Adem Limit blong WIP",
  "wip-limit-group-select-swimlane": "Jusum Rod",
  "wip-limit-group-apply-swimlane": "Yusum long swimlane",
  "board-view-time": "Taem",
  "time-adjustments": "Ol jenis blong taem folem man we i raetem",
  "time-adjustment-note": "Ol jenis long ol aoa we oli rekodem, grupum folem man we i jenisim totel. Hemia i no ol wanwan sesen blong wok. Ol negativ valiu oli blong stretem. I no save talem hu i mekem taem bifo we oli no rekodem.",
  "auto-archive-days": "Putum ol kad long stoa afta long namba blong dei ia we i no gat jenis",
  "auto-archive-off": "Of",
  "auto-archive-hint": "Hem i jekem evri aoa. Taem wan kad i jenis, hem i kaont olsem kad we i gat aktiviti; ol templet oli neva go long stoa. Livim bokis i emti blong stopem hem.",
  "import-board-instruction-markdown": "Putum kopi blong wan lis blong wok long markdown (fasin we ol tul blong markdown-kanban olsem Obsidian Kanban oli yusum): ol hed tok \"## List name\", wetem ol samting \"- [ ]\"/\"- [x]\" aninit. Ol hed tok oli kam ol lis mo ol samting oli kam ol kad; wan simpol lis wetem ol mak mo no gat ol bokis blong tikim i save kam insaed tu, olsem ol kad we oli open.",
  "import-board-instruction-opml": "Putum kopi blong wan plan blong OPML, olsem Workflowy, Dynalist, OmniOutliner, Logseq mo ol narafala tul blong plan oli eksportem. Ol samting long hae level oli kam ol lis, ol pikinini blong olgeta oli kam ol kad wetem not olsem diskripsen, mo ol samting we oli stap moa daon oli kam ol lis blong jekem. Ol samting we oli finis oli kam insaed olsem wok we i finis.",
  "import-board-instruction-todotxt": "Putum kopi blong fael todo.txt: wan wok long wanwan laen, olsem app todo.txt mo ol app we oli wok wetem hem oli raetem. Ol wok we oli finis (\"x\") oli go long haf blong ol wok we oli finis, +project mo @context oli kam ol lebel, (A) i kam lebel blong wok we i mas kam fastaem, mo due: mo t: oli kam ol det blong finisim mo statem wok.",
  "import-board-instruction-taskwarrior": "Putum aotput blong task export: wan JSON array o wan wok long wanwan laen. Ol wok we oli finis oli go long Done, project mo priority oli kam ol mak, annotations i kam ol komen, mo depends i kam ol samting we oli mas wet long ol wok we oli blokem.",
  "import-board-instruction-meistertask": "Long MeisterTask, klik long nem blong projek, jusum Export project mo sendem CSV i go, afta pestem. Ol seksen oli kam ol lis mo ol wok oli kam ol kad, wetem not, dedlaen, man we i gat wok mo ol tag blong olgeta; ol wok we i finis oli kipim deit we oli finis. Wan CSV we oli raetem blong MeisterTask i wok tu.",
  "import-board-instruction-obsidian": "Long Obsidian, openem fael blong Kanban bod olsem Markdown (o openem fael .md long wan teks edita), afta pestem evri samting. Ol lein oli kam ol lis wetem limit blong kad, ol kad oli kipim ol tag, deit, praeoriti, fil mo jeklis blong olgeta, mo Archive i kam ol kad long akaev.",
  "import-board-instruction-linear": "Long Linear, sendem ol isiu i go olsem CSV (Settings, Import / Export, Export data, o eksport blong wan viu), afta pestem CSV. Ol stetas oli kam ol lis, ol tim oli kam ol rod, mo ol isiu oli kam ol kad wetem man we i gat wok, ol mak, deit, papa isiu, praeoriti, estimet, projek mo saekol blong olgeta.",
  "import-board-instruction-ticktick": "Long TickTick, openem Settings, Account, Backup & Import mo mekem wan bakap, afta pestem fael CSV. Evri lis blong TickTick i kam wan rod mo ol kolum blong hem oli kam ol lis; ol wok oli kipim ol tag, deit, jeklis, praeoriti mo smol wok blong olgeta.",
  "import-board-instruction-clickup": "Long ClickUp, sendem ol wok i go olsem CSV (Settings, Imports / Exports, Export Items, o eksport blong wan List o Table viu wetem evri kolum), afta pestem CSV. Ol stetas oli kam ol lis, ol lis blong ClickUp oli kam ol rod, mo ol wok oli kam ol kad wetem smol wok, man we i gat wok, tag, deit, praeoriti mo taem blong olgeta.",
  "import-board-instruction-nullboard": "Long Nullboard, openem bod, jusum Export this board... long menu, openem fael .nbx long wan teks edita mo pestem samting we i stap insaed. Ol lis oli kam ol lis mo ol not oli kam ol kad: fes laen blong wan not i nem blong kad mo narafala i stori blong hem. Wan not we i raw i kasem mak raw. Long wan fael we i gat plante bod, fes bod nomo i kam.",
  "import-board-instruction-kanri": "Long Kanri, openem Import & Export mo jusum Export individual board (o Export all data), afta pestem fael .json. Ol kolum oli kam ol lis mo ol kad oli kam ol kad, wetem stori, dedlaen, tag mo kala blong olgeta; ol wok blong wan kad oli kam wan jeklis. Long wan eksport blong evri data, fes bod i kam.",
  "import-board-instruction-pivotal": "Long Pivotal Tracker, openem tab MORE blong projek mo jusum Export CSV (o jusum ol stori mo jusum Bulk Actions, CSV), afta pestem CSV. Evri stet blong stori i kam wan lis mo ol stori oli kam ol kad, wetem kaen mo ol mak, ona, man we i askem, deit, toktok, wok mo ol samting we i blokem blong olgeta; Estimate i kam Story points mo ol iteresen oli kam ol sprint.",
  "import-board-instruction-tasksorg": "Long Tasks.org, openem Settings, Backups mo jusum Export tasks, afta pestem samting we i stap insaed long fael .json ia. Ol lis oli kam ol lis mo ol wok oli kam ol kad, wetem not, tag, deit, toktok mo smol wok blong olgeta; ol wok we i finis oli kipim deit we oli finis, mo praeoriti i kam wan fil blong yu.",
  "import-board-instruction-monday": "Long monday.com, openem menu blong bod, jusum More actions mo Export board to Excel (wetem ol apdet mo ol smol samting sapos yu wantem), afta jusum fael .xlsx ia. Kolum Status i kam ol lis mo ol grup oli kam ol rod; ol man, deit, taemlaen mo tag oli stap long ples blong olgeta, ol narafala kolum oli kam ol fil blong yu mo ol apdet oli kam ol toktok.",
  "import-board-instruction-superproductivity": "Long Super Productivity, openem Settings, afta Sync & Backup, jusum Export Data mo pestem samting we i stap insaed long fael .json sp-backup. Evri projek i kam wan rod mo ol wok oli kam ol kad long To Do, In Progress, Backlog o Done, wetem not, tag, dedlaen, taem we oli yusum mo smol wok blong olgeta; ol wok long akaev oli kam ol kad long akaev.",
  "import-board-instruction-quire": "Long Quire, openem menu blong projek mo jusum Export CSV, afta pestem CSV. Ol stetas oli kam ol lis mo ol wok oli kam ol kad, wetem smol wok olsem pikinini kad, man we i gat wok, tag olsem mak, deit blong stat, dedlaen mo deit we i finis, stori mo praeoriti olsem wan fil blong yu. Ol toktok mo atajmen oli no stap long CSV blong Quire.",
  "import-board-instruction-wrike": "Long Wrike, sendem wan projek o folda i go long Excel, o fulumap templet blong Excel import blong Wrike, afta jusum fael .xlsx ia. Ol laen blong folda mo projek oli kam ol rod, Status i kam ol lis mo ol wok oli kam ol kad, wetem Key, papa wok, man we i gat wok, deit blong stat mo en, ol samting we oli dipen long hem mo stori blong olgeta; Priority, Duration mo ol narafala kolum oli kam ol fil blong yu.",
  "import-board-instruction-teamwork": "Long Teamwork.com, fulumap templet blong Excel wok import (Tasklist, Task, Description, Assign to, Start date, Due date, Priority, Estimated time, Tags, Status) mo sevem olsem .xlsx, afta jusum fael ia. Ol lis blong wok oli kam ol lis mo ol wok oli kam ol kad; wan wok we i stat wetem -, # o > i kam smol wok blong wok we i stap antap long hem (--, ## o >> wan level daon moa). Man we i gat wok, deit mo tag oli stap long ples blong olgeta; Priority, Estimated time mo Complete oli kam ol fil blong yu.",
  "import-board-instruction-businessmap": "Long Businessmap (bifo Kanbanize), openem Advanced Search, jusum Configure results blong jusum ol kolum, daonlodem fael Excel, afta jusum fael .xlsx ia. Oli ridim ol kolum long nem blong olgeta long Inglis (Title, Column, Lane, Owner, Deadline ...): sapos akaon blong yu i yusum narafala lanwis, fes, jenisim nem blong laen blong hed i go long Inglis. Column i kam ol lis mo Lane i kam ol rod; ona, tag, kala, deit, toktok mo link blong papa oli stap long ples blong olgeta, mo Priority, Size, Type mo ol narafala kolum oli kam ol fil blong yu.",
  "import-board-instruction-redmine": "Long Redmine, openem Issues blong projek, jusum Also available in: CSV long botom blong lis, jusum ol kolum (All columns, wetem Description) mo sendem i go, afta pestem CSV. Redmine i putum nem blong ol kolum long lanwis blong yu, ale jenisim lanwis blong yu i go long Inglis long My account bifo yu sendem i go. Evri stetas i kam wan lis mo ol isiu oli kam ol kad, wetem treka olsem mak, man we i gat wok, man we i raetem, deit, papa wok mo ol isiu we oli joen; praeoriti, kategori, vesen we oli wantem kasem, taem we oli tingbaot, % Done mo ol fil blong yu oli kam ol fil blong yu."
}